# Lepramim — native Rust ignores

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Model artifacts are cached under ~/.cache/lepramim/ by design — not in the repo
# This entry is just defensive in case someone runs cwd-relative caching.
models/
*.onnx
*.bin

tmp/

# External tool metadata
.codex
.aider*
.cursor/
.idea/
.vscode/

### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
debug/
target/
# Keep Cargo.lock committed for reproducible builds (binary)
# See https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds
*.pdb

### Native build ###
build/
# CMake artifacts (presets: dev, ci, release)
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
compile_commands.json
*.cmake
!CMakeLists.txt
!CMakePresets.json

